# IoT Applications in Industrial Automation

## 📌 CodeAlpha IoT Internship – Task 1

This project is a research report on the **applications of Internet of Things (IoT) in Industrial Automation**, also known as the **Industrial Internet of Things (IIoT)**.

## 📖 Introduction

The Internet of Things (IoT) connects physical devices, sensors, and machines through networks to collect and exchange data.

In industries, IoT is commonly referred to as **Industrial Internet of Things (IIoT)**. It connects manufacturing equipment, sensors, and control systems to enable:

* Real-time monitoring
* Predictive maintenance
* Data-driven decision-making
* Improved operational efficiency
* Reduced downtime

IIoT plays an important role in the transition toward **Industry 4.0**.

